WEBVTT

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.243
devastated by racist policy.

00:05:32.411 --> 00:05:36.290
We've tapped into a hunger and appetite

00:05:36.332 --> 00:05:40.211
hiding in the blind spots
of the traditional capital markets.

00:05:41.629 --> 00:05:44.548
Remember those folks
that laughed me out of the room?

00:05:45.257 --> 00:05:46.509
Well, we have more --

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.010
Within just two years' time,

00:05:48.052 --> 00:05:51.847
we now have more demand for our homes
than we have homes.

00:05:51.889 --> 00:05:53.140
We're sold out.

00:05:54.016 --> 00:05:58.396
And so can we do development
without displacement?

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.482
We absolutely can.